{"id":"00407","root":"uni00407_1","name":{"ja":"清水　神流","en":"Shimizu Kanna"},"title":{"ja":"【学園生活】","en":"【School Life】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【学園生活】 清水　神流","en":"【School Life】 Shimizu Kanna"},"aliases":["Shimizu Kaminaru"],"element":"Natural","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-11-30","limited":false,"characterId":141,"profile":{"ja":"五車学園に通っている対魔忍。氷遁の術を使い、対魔忍としてもいくつかの任務に就き着実に経験と実績を積み重ねている。任務中は常に杖を装備しており、その杖を使って氷遁を操る。この杖は水城ゆきかぜの銃同様に自身の強すぎる力を制御するために用いるものである。身長は１５０センチと小柄で、本人は少しコンプレックスを感じている。ちなみに身長の割に胸が発達していることも彼女的にはコンプレックスだったりする。後輩からは慕われていて、特に七瀬舞とは仲が良いが、ゆきかぜや雫からは胸元になんともいえない視線を感じることも。任務が終わり、報告書を提出した彼女は久しぶりに制服に袖を通し、五車学園に登校。次の任務が決まるまでの間、つかのまの学園生活を過ごすのであった。","en":"She is a Taimanin attending Gosha Academy. Using ice-walk techniques, she has steadily built experience and a solid record across several missions. During missions she always equips a staff, which she uses to manipulate ice-walk. Like Mizuki Yukikaze's gun, the staff helps her control her own overwhelming power. Standing at 150 cm, she feels a bit self-conscious about her small stature, and is also uneasy about her relatively developed bust. She is admired by juniors, especially getting along well with Nanase Mai, though she sometimes senses an indescribable gaze from Yukikaze and Shizuku toward her chest. After finishing a mission and submitting her report, she puts on her uniform again and returns to Gosha Academy, spending a brief period of school life until her next assignment."},"illustrator":"ほむらゆに","voiceActor":"卯眠 ざくろ","forms":[{"id":"uni00407_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1048,2096],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[153,306],"def":[109,218],"spd":[62,62],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","870007"]},{"id":"uni00407_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1596,3192],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[241,482],"def":[153,306],"spd":[62,62],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","870007","870008"]},{"id":"uni00407_3","rari